    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="f31a61a8-7ea1-5207-96ea-66c70f6dfa62" activityNameId="0e014379-cd4e-5354-bc53-1d44545015f0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Multimedia gateway, for customer premise equipment (CPE)</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Multimedia gateway, for customer premise equipment (CPE)
The data set represents the multimedia gateway networks in Switzerland; UUID: 3e6dfd27-c5c2-3743-b85c-67408d9c64bd
The dataset is based on the Samsung SMT-G7400 equipment. The conversion of weights to pieces for power supply units and HDDs are based on existing UVEK datasets. The types of polymers used are taken from the polymers currently in use within existing chasis and router datasets. The proportion is 1:1:1 for HDPE:PVC:PP. No information from the literature regarding the type of steel was found. Hence, it was assumed that low-alloyed steel was used. The total mass of the equipment is 3.79 kg. The functional unit = 1 GB.
Location: Data for Swiss networks
Technology: Swiss use CPE transmission networks.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3e6dfd27-c5c2-3743-b85c-67408d9c64bd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
